// Package fuzzy is Encore's multi-language fuzzy matching library, used by the title matcher (internal/core/match). Its subpackages are small and independent: phonetic defines the Encoder interface and the language registry, and phonetic/en, phonetic/de, phonetic/fr, phonetic/es and phonetic/pt each provide one encoder and register it when imported. phonetic/ar builds the Arabic encoder on phonetic/en's Double Metaphone. tinyseg splits Japanese text into words for the matcher, a port of TinySegmenter under its BSD licence.
package fuzzy
